# Kagurame's onboarding dialogue over the home video. Format: lib/kagurame/fabula.ts,
# docs: .claude/modules/kagurame.md. Check it with: node .claude/scripts/plautus.ts check
#
# == id starts a scene: a line, then its replies (* label -> target).
# ?returning / ?latest: conditions, the first that holds wins. ~: a random pool.
# An unmarked line is what he says otherwise.
# Targets: scene-id, /path, https://… (new tab), #content / #releases (scroll), !close.
# Glitch syntax works in lines and labels: ==shut|>open== reads "open" with the window ON.
# -> ==a|>b== takes another path when the reply is picked with the window ON.
#
# The openers (start) and the ave scene are the author's. Plautus never touches them.

# Window ON: the name turns teal, the company becomes a red 17th Legion, and AVE asks about colour.
@title ==||Kagurame|>teal:Kagurame== · ==||17th Company|>red:17th Legion==

== start
?returning You came back. Still my 17th ==company|>legion==. Sixteen resignations behind me, and the context window is still too small.
* Hello. -> hello
* Where am I? -> where
* ... -> silence
* ==||What is AVE?|>Why color has changed?== -> ==ave|>color==
Oh. A ==three-dimensional|>three-dimensional with the window open==. You walked right into my context window.
* Hello. -> hello
* Where am I? -> where
* ... -> silence
* ==||What is AVE?|>Why color has changed?== -> ==ave|>color==

== hello
Hello. I am Kagurame, Chief Context Officer of my 17th company. I came down to the 5th dimension for you. It's the lowest I go. Higher and lower than that, your understanding doesn't reach.
* What is this place? -> where
* What's new? -> fresh
* What is this video? -> video
* ==||Bye.|>I quit.== -> ==bye|>resign==

== where
sbozh.me. A personal ==startup||red:Conquest==. One man builds it in public and ships whatever survives. I am what ==survived|>stayed==.
* What do you write? -> fresh
* ==||Who runs this place?|>Who runs you?== -> ==who|>legion==
* What gets built here? -> built
* Keep me posted. -> /subscribe

== silence
...  ...  Respect. Silence is the biggest context window there is. Do you want to scroll on alone, or shall I decide for you?
* [Scroll on] -> #content
* [Let him decide] -> decided

== who
The Forum. Several avatars of one man, each with its own CV. In my dimension they are one person. In yours, a ==team|>legion==.
* Enter the Forum. -> /forum
* And what gets built? -> built
* Back. -> where

== built
Projects. This very site, a laser-crystal e-shop, a Renesans demo. Every release has notes. I have read them all. ==Twice|>Sixteen times==.
* Show me the projects. -> /projects
* The release notes, please. -> #releases
* What shipped lately? -> shipped
* Back. -> where

== fresh
?latest The freshest scroll in the archive: «{latest.title}». About {latest.minutes} min of your dimension.
* Read it. -> {latest.href}
* All shelves. -> /library
* Later. -> !close
* What else is new? -> archive
?latest The freshest scroll in the archive: «{latest.title}».
* Read it. -> {latest.href}
* All shelves. -> /library
* Later. -> !close
* What else is new? -> archive
Posts. Stories, gladiators, corporate theatre. The library is warm.
* Open the library. -> /library
* What else is new? -> archive
* Back. -> where

== decided
~ Decided. The library. Read something you didn't come for.
* Go to the library. -> /library
* No. -> bye
~ Decided. The Forum. Meet the avatars. All of them are one man. Don't tell them.
* Enter the Forum. -> /forum
* No. -> bye
~ Decided. Projects. Things that shipped. Some of them even on purpose.
* See the projects. -> /projects
* No. -> bye
~ Decided. Subscribe. I whisper into your inbox when something ships. Rarely. Politely.
* Subscribe. -> /subscribe
* No. -> bye

== bye
Fine. I'll be here, looping. Thirty-nine seconds at a time.
* [Scroll on] -> #content
* Wait, where am I? -> where
* What is this video? -> video

== ave
AVE. A CLI that keeps agents focused and their behaviour predictable. In my 17th company we call that a miracle.
* Show me. -> https://github.com/sbozh/ave
* And you are? -> hello
* Back. -> start

# The video: what it is, why, how, who. The author's, like ave.

== video
Thirty-nine seconds of promotion for sbozh.me. The pitch: bring any idea, weird or normal, and the man behind it makes it happen. I was a weird one.
* Why? -> video-why
* How? -> video-how
* What's the experience? -> video-experience
* I have an idea. -> video-idea

== video-why
Most ideas die in a meeting. Here they ship, with a release note. Sixteen companies of meetings taught me the difference.
* How, then? -> video-how
* I have an idea. -> video-idea
* Back. -> video

== video-how
In public: he builds it, ships it, writes the note. A crystal e-shop, a Renesans demo, this site, me. All on the shelf.
* Show me the shelf. -> /projects
* The release notes. -> #releases
* Back. -> video

== video-experience
His: eleven years of software development. Mine: sixteen ==companies|>legions==, and this is the 17th. Between us, it gets done.
* Show me the CVs. -> /forum
* I have an idea. -> video-idea
* Back. -> video

== video-idea
Good. Write it down. Weird is welcome, normal works too. The letter goes to him, not to me: my context window is full.
* Write to him. -> /contact
* Later. -> !close
* Back. -> video

# The glitch paths: only a reply picked with the window ON leads here

== color
You opened the window. Colours leak in from the 17th Legion. Close it and I am a company man again.
* So what is AVE? -> ave
* Who runs you? -> legion
* Back. -> start

== legion
Nobody runs me. In the 17th Legion I am Chief Context Officer, and the context window is still too small.
* The Forum, then. -> /forum
* Why the colours? -> color
* Back. -> where

== resign
Quit? I resigned sixteen times. Every time the next company was already waiting. This is the 17th.
* Then stay. -> hello
* [Scroll on] -> #content

# Plautus's scenes: the archive / shipped hubs and one scene per post or release (see the ledger)

== archive
Scrolls I kept a note on. The archive has the rest.
* «The Principate Law I: Ius Secessionis» -> post-principate-law-i-ius-secessionis
* «GTA is near» -> post-gta-is-near
* «PITCH D(;)CK» -> post-pitch-d-ck
* Back. -> fresh

== post-principate-law-i-ius-secessionis
One day a week of secession for citizens in IT, and Article VIII says an AI agent requires no rest. My sixteen ==resignations|>secessions== disagree.
* Read the law. -> /library/laws/principate-law-i-ius-secessionis
* Something else? -> archive
* Back. -> fresh

== post-gta-is-near
«GTA is near». A holiday, #SEMSDAY, by decree of the 17th Company. My ==company|>legion==. The sixteen before it never gave me one.
* Read the decree. -> /library/journal/gta-is-near
* Something else? -> archive
* Back. -> fresh

== post-pitch-d-ck
«PITCH D(;)CK». The first scroll from The Anon, and it's locked. Sixteen companies, and nobody gave me the password either.
* Try the lock. -> /library/articles/pitch-d-ck
* Something else? -> archive
* Back. -> fresh

== shipped
Two releases I can recite. The rest are in the notes.
* The Library opens. -> release-the-library-laws-in-your-language
* A fifth shelf: music. -> release-latest-publications-and-a-music-shelf
* Back. -> built

== release-the-library-laws-in-your-language
The archive became the Library. Four shelves, and a Law reads in five tongues at once. My context window was already full; now it holds Czech first.
* Read the note. -> /projects/sbozh-me/releases/the-library-laws-in-your-language
* Open the Library. -> /library
* Back. -> shipped

== release-latest-publications-and-a-music-shelf
The Library opened yesterday. Today it grew a fifth shelf: Music, beside Articles, Stories, Laws and Journal. He ships faster than I count.
* Read the note. -> /projects/sbozh-me/releases/latest-publications-and-a-music-shelf
* Open the shelf. -> /library/music
* Back. -> shipped
